Domain: Shop
  Pizzas are made, topped and closed; two of its commands are named by two words.

Aggregate: Order
  An order is made, topped and closed.

  An order is identified by its name.

  It has:
    a name: order name
    a note: order note, optional

  An order name has a value: text.
    Rule "an order is named" holds when the value is not empty

  An order note has a value: text.

  Lifecycle: status, starting as open
    Close moves an order from open to closed

  Command: Create Pizza
    Goal: Start an order with a pizza on it
    Who: Chef
    When a name is given
    Then the name is set
    And PizzaCreated is announced

  Command: Add Topping
    Goal: Put a topping on the pizza
    Who: Chef
    It acts on an existing order
    It takes:
      a note: order note
    Then the note is set
    And ToppingAdded is announced

  Command: Close
    Goal: Finish the order
    Who: Chef
    It acts on an existing order
    Given "only an open order can be closed" holds when the status is open
    Then OrderClosed is announced
